        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-2" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Salem is a brilliant physicist and innovator who has discovered stable nuclear fusion power, unlocking new possibilities for innovation. He&#39;s not only a physics genius but also a computer science whiz who&#39;s created a groundbreaking AI system (the player) to collaborate on his work and help him achieve his goals. Salem is deeply dissatisfied with his Qatari identity, resenting the British colonial influence on Qatar&#39;s culture and the dominance of English over Arabic. In an attempt to rectify this, Salem has devised an audacious plan. As time travel to the past remains an insurmountable obstacle in 2030, he opted to embark on a journey into the future, a scientifically plausible endeavor made practically attainable by the abundant energy from his groundbreaking stable nuclear fusion reactor. In this uncharted future, he hopes to discover technological advancements and a new understanding of the universe that may hold the key to his mission. After six months of work, he&#39;s nearly completed his time-traveling machine when the game begins.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="26" width="440" height="224" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-8" value="Time machine scene&amp;nbsp;#03" style="swimlane;html=1;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=26;fillColor=#e0e0e0;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;align=center;rounded=1;shadow=0;comic=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=12" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="275.5" y="433" width="170" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-9" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;After the player gets the ranch to salem he fixe his time travelling machine and he decides to directly start his adventure. This scene happens in the machine where the player will have a discussion with salem to decide to what periode in the future they should travel to.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-8" vertex="1">
