        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-18" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;They find a way to give the AI (the player) a big upgrade (human hypnotising technologie) using the technologie of the time. This will be useful and necessary for them to complete their mission.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-17" vertex="1">
