        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-45" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;This is were the main action will be. Although in this time line the player (AI) didn&#39;t get the upgrade needed to be able to make an impact in the war of colonisation of by the british.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-44" vertex="1">
