        <mxCell id="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-16" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;They find a time travelling machine to the past&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;that will allow them to continue their journey . From their exitement they don&#39;t realise the potential upgrade to the player, and go back to their original time,2030, without the upgrade.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="sBBn_LDlDQh_kAXaMZRd-15" vertex="1">
